  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Construction — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Construction, as the name implies, allows the user to conjure objects from nothing.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st, you can create any kind of object you understand with your technique, although without much efficiency. As a bonus action for 3 CE, you create one non-magical weapon OR simple object that fits in a 3 ft cube in your hand or within 5 ft of you, as long as you have basic understanding and information of its properties. </p>\n<p>You can spend additional CE to create an object with one additional object’s properties or increase the cube by 1 ft. (Eg. You create a greatsword mixed with a spear with both the Heavy, two-handed, and the Versatile and Thrown (20/60) properties. When mixing a light and heavy weapon, choose which property it will maintain.)</p>",
